        "cooked": "<p>Sounds to me like he's assuming GtG is focusing more on upcoming stuff than stuff that's already been paid for, which is probably true. &nbsp;The stuff that's already been paid for is more \"done\" than the upcoming stuff, so it requires less attention. &nbsp;If what someone cared about is what they've paid for and all they see is talk about upcoming stuff, I'll bet that's frustrating.</p>",
