        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-01T13:10:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Don't worry, &gt;G have demonstrated great reliability in getting stuff done, making their games and to a high standard and all that so that everyone gets what they paid for and stuff :). Making these kinds of games just taks a while, that's all. If you want to see a really <span class=\"bbcode-i\">bad</span> Kickstarter, check out Godus.</p>",
